  <title>Release notes from vllm</title>
  <updated>2026-10-17T18:57:10Z</updated>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/599547518/v0.32.0</id>
    <updated>2026-10-18T09:41:08Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/releases/tag/v0.32.0"/>
    <title>v0.32.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;v0.32.0&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release features 814 commits from 363 contributors (121 new)!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured decisions and generic parsers&lt;/strong&gt;: the new &lt;code&gt;POST /v1/systemone&lt;/code&gt; endpoint answers &lt;code&gt;choice&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;noul&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;score&lt;/code&gt; questions over a structured state (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5636788960&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59299&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59299/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59299&quot;&gt;#59299&lt;/a&gt;), is served by default (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5765828460&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60677&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60677/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60677&quot;&gt;#60677&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5767685666&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60696&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60696/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60696&quot;&gt;#60696&lt;/a&gt;), and also runs on &lt;code&gt;Cloudflare/clef-omni&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5799624841&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/61064&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61064/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61064&quot;&gt;#61064&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;code&gt;LiquidAI/d1-3B&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5765800100&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60676&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60676/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60676&quot;&gt;#60676&lt;/a&gt;) and DiffusionGemma (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5750472467&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60466&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60466/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60466&quot;&gt;#60466&lt;/a&gt;). The new &lt;code&gt;hf&lt;/code&gt; tool and reasoning parser (&lt;code&gt;--tool-call-parser hf&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--reasoning-parser hf&lt;/code&gt;) reads the checkpoint&#39;s &lt;code&gt;response_template&lt;/code&gt;, so models that ship it need no model-specific parser (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5573097826&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58604&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58604/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58604&quot;&gt;#58604&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5573096903&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58602&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58602/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58602&quot;&gt;#58602&lt;/a&gt;), in both the Python and Rust frontends (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5612096309&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59005&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59005/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59005&quot;&gt;#59005&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low-precision KV cache everywhere&lt;/strong&gt;: NVFP4 KV cache now runs on SM8x and SM12x (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4762762363&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46963&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46963/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46963&quot;&gt;#46963&lt;/a&gt;), SM90 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5760833550&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60620&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60620/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60620&quot;&gt;#60620&lt;/a&gt;) and with XQA decode on SM12x (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5749725957&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60452&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60452/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60452&quot;&gt;#60452&lt;/a&gt;), and on MiniMax-M3 sparse attention on SM100 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5636790517&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59300&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59300/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59300&quot;&gt;#59300&lt;/a&gt;); GLM-5.x defaults to an FP8 KV cache on SM100 for 2.3-5.5% more throughput (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5720012545&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60140&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60140/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60140&quot;&gt;#60140&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5733792962&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60281&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60281/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60281&quot;&gt;#60281&lt;/a&gt;); &lt;code&gt;fp8_ds_mla&lt;/code&gt; on SM90 gives GLM-5.3-Flash up to 31% more output throughput (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5633108180&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59246&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59246/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59246&quot;&gt;#59246&lt;/a&gt;); ROCm gains the 4-bit &lt;code&gt;ultraquant_4bit&lt;/code&gt; KV cache with about 2x the density of FP8 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5466023019&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57057&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57057/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57057&quot;&gt;#57057&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Runner V2&lt;/strong&gt;: a GPU n-gram speculator with variable-length drafts (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4315989892&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/40704&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/40704/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/40704&quot;&gt;#40704&lt;/a&gt;), Elastic EP (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5260364635&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/53934&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/53934/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/53934&quot;&gt;#53934&lt;/a&gt;), pipeline parallelism with prefill context parallelism (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5625237878&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59139&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59139/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59139&quot;&gt;#59139&lt;/a&gt;), a stock torch.compile mode (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5619180853&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59079&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59079/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59079&quot;&gt;#59079&lt;/a&gt;), and MRV2 is now the default for all models on ROCm (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5418857766&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56360&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56360/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56360&quot;&gt;#56360&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Faster startup and serving&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;vllm download-kernels&lt;/code&gt; installs FlashInfer&#39;s precompiled kernels (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5586831846&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58765&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58765/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58765&quot;&gt;#58765&lt;/a&gt;); &lt;code&gt;vllm preload --preload-autotune&lt;/code&gt; keeps the FlashInfer autotune table warm across restarts (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5716418000&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60085&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60085/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60085&quot;&gt;#60085&lt;/a&gt;); a shared-memory tensor arena broadcasts large multimodal tensors to workers with one copy (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5076100188&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51207&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51207/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51207&quot;&gt;#51207&lt;/a&gt;); tokenizers and processors load from the local snapshot (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5776176654&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60825&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60825/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60825&quot;&gt;#60825&lt;/a&gt;); and with &lt;code&gt;--api-server-count&lt;/code&gt; above 1 each connection goes to the least-loaded API worker, for 43-85% more req/s on short requests (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5769513146&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60723&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60723/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60723&quot;&gt;#60723&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model support&lt;/strong&gt;: new EmbeddingGemma 2 omni-modal embeddings (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5731189728&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60254&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60254/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60254&quot;&gt;#60254&lt;/a&gt;), MiniCPM-V 4.7 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5579220885&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58674&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58674/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58674&quot;&gt;#58674&lt;/a&gt;) and Nemotron 3.5 ASR (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5684536277&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59827&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59827/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59827&quot;&gt;#59827&lt;/a&gt;); video input in the Transformers modeling backend (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5492167141&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57441&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57441/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57441&quot;&gt;#57441&lt;/a&gt;); GLM-5.3 sparse MLA index conversions reused across layers (3.5-3.9x on that kernel, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5650103373&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59464&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59464/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59464&quot;&gt;#59464&lt;/a&gt;) and fused multi-step draft decode (13.3% at concurrency 1, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5492650282&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57443&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57443/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57443&quot;&gt;#57443&lt;/a&gt;); HiSparse per-request residency caching for up to 58% more throughput (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5716252816&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60083&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60083/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60083&quot;&gt;#60083&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security&lt;/strong&gt;: fixes for &lt;a title=&quot;GHSA-4hhp-h66f-j5j7&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;advisory&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/advisories/GHSA-4hhp-h66f-j5j7/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-4hhp-h66f-j5j7&quot;&gt;GHSA-4hhp-h66f-j5j7&lt;/a&gt; (chat template resource exhaustion, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5011829213&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50300&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50300/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50300&quot;&gt;#50300&lt;/a&gt;), GHSA-q97c-p368-75c4 (tokenizer &lt;code&gt;max_token_id&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5652533162&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59491&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59491/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59491&quot;&gt;#59491&lt;/a&gt;) and GHSA-frvg-qw88-hww9 (P2P ZMQ socket exhaustion, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5098151186&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/51504&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51504/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51504&quot;&gt;#51504&lt;/a&gt;); CORS no longer allows every origin by default (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5793054798&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/61009&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61009/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61009&quot;&gt;#61009&lt;/a&gt;); untrusted images are limited to raster formats (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5708038313&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60022&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60022/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60022&quot;&gt;#60022&lt;/a&gt;); shared-memory multimodal cache handles are signed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5640410316&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59357&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59357/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59357&quot;&gt;#59357&lt;/a&gt;); and JSON schemas nested deeper than 64 levels are rejected (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5709435782&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60036&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60036/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60036&quot;&gt;#60036&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Breaking changes&lt;/strong&gt;: Python 3.10 dropped (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5746030133&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60402&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60402/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60402&quot;&gt;#60402&lt;/a&gt;); default CORS origins restricted (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5793054798&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/61009&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61009/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61009&quot;&gt;#61009&lt;/a&gt;); &lt;code&gt;transformers&amp;gt;=5.16.1&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;tokenizers&amp;gt;=0.23.2&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5488278841&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57387&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57387/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57387&quot;&gt;#57387&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5679973595&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59796&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59796/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59796&quot;&gt;#59796&lt;/a&gt;); torch.compile sequence parallelism and AsyncTP passes removed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5754581997&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60517&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60517/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60517&quot;&gt;#60517&lt;/a&gt;); cascade attention removed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5806861935&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/61126&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61126/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61126&quot;&gt;#61126&lt;/a&gt;); &lt;code&gt;mamba_cache_mode=&quot;all&quot;&lt;/code&gt; removed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5611877875&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58997&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58997/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58997&quot;&gt;#58997&lt;/a&gt;); &lt;code&gt;max_tokens&lt;/code&gt; no longer reserved from the context window (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5464273173&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57035&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57035/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57035&quot;&gt;#57035&lt;/a&gt;); Responses API reasoning stream events renamed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5666244889&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59652&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59652/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59652&quot;&gt;#59652&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Release Artifacts&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Python Wheels&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Platform&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Install&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;PyPI (CUDA 13.0)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;pip install vllm&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;PyPI (CUDA 13.0, uv)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv pip install vllm --torch-backend=auto&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;ROCm&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;pip install vllm --extra-index-url https://wheels.vllm.ai/rocm/0.32.0/rocm723&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;XPU&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;uv pip install vllm --extra-index-url https://wheels.vllm.ai/0.32.0/xpu --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/xpu --index-strategy unsafe-best-match&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Docker Images&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Platform&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Docker Image&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;CUDA 13.0 (Default)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai:v0.32.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;CUDA 12.9&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai:v0.32.0-cu129&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;ROCm&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai-rocm:v0.32.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;CPU&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai-cpu:v0.32.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;XPU&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;docker pull vllm/vllm-openai-xpu:v0.32.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Artifacts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pre-built release artifacts are available in the &lt;strong&gt;Assets&lt;/strong&gt; section at the bottom of this page, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source distribution tarball&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CUDA 12.9 Python wheels for x86_64 and arm64&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CUDA 13.0 Python wheels for x86_64 and arm64&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPU Python wheels for x86_64, arm64, and macOS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;XPU Python wheel for x86_64&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Model Support&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New models&lt;/strong&gt;: EmbeddingGemma 2 (&lt;code&gt;google/embeddinggemma-2&lt;/code&gt;), an omni-modal text/image/audio/video embedding model, with unused modality encoders skipped through &lt;code&gt;--limit-mm-per-prompt&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5731189728&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60254&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60254/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60254&quot;&gt;#60254&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5734309521&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60289&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60289/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60289&quot;&gt;#60289&lt;/a&gt;); MiniCPM-V 4.7 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5579220885&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58674&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58674/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58674&quot;&gt;#58674&lt;/a&gt;); Nemotron 3.5 ASR streaming transcription (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5684536277&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59827&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59827/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59827&quot;&gt;#59827&lt;/a&gt;); &lt;code&gt;Cloudflare/clef-omni&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5799624841&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/61064&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61064/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/61064&quot;&gt;#61064&lt;/a&gt;) and &lt;code&gt;LiquidAI/d1-3B&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5765800100&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60676&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60676/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60676&quot;&gt;#60676&lt;/a&gt;) on &lt;code&gt;/v1/systemone&lt;/code&gt;; PLaMo 3 reasoning and tool parsers (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5431719297&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56575&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56575/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56575&quot;&gt;#56575&lt;/a&gt;); and the zerank-2 reranker score template (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5747109860&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60415&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60415/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60415&quot;&gt;#60415&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformers modeling backend&lt;/strong&gt;: video inputs (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5492167141&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57441&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57441/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57441&quot;&gt;#57441&lt;/a&gt;), and Glm, Arcee, CWM, Mellum (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5668362474&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59679&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59679/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59679&quot;&gt;#59679&lt;/a&gt;), GPT-NeoX, Phi, Seed-OSS and Jais2 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5670334829&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59701&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59701/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59701&quot;&gt;#59701&lt;/a&gt;) now served through it.&lt;/li&gt;
