&lt;h2&gt;Quantization&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;: online re-quantization of linear layers (&lt;code&gt;--quantization-config.linear fp8_per_channel&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5372095168&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/55684&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/55684/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/55684&quot;&gt;#55684&lt;/a&gt;), per-token NVFP4 CuTe-DSL MoE (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4991069128&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50030&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50030/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50030&quot;&gt;#50030&lt;/a&gt;) with ReLU2 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5444268193&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56740&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56740/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56740&quot;&gt;#56740&lt;/a&gt;), MXFP4 MoE oracle with CUTLASS W4A4 and BF16 fallback (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5716019227&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/60079&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60079/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60079&quot;&gt;#60079&lt;/a&gt;), compressed-tensors MXFP4 MoE with FP8 activations (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5682038309&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59815&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59815/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59815&quot;&gt;#59815&lt;/a&gt;), ModelOpt IQ2_XS/IQ2_XXS/Q8_0 on SM120/SM121 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5662969229&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59604&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59604/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59604&quot;&gt;#59604&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;code&gt;int4_per_token_head&lt;/code&gt; KV with non-power-of-two heads (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5408145418&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56198&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56198/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56198&quot;&gt;#56198&lt;/a&gt;), and Humming preferred over Marlin on SM90 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5461092276&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56997&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56997/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56997&quot;&gt;#56997&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
