&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New options and endpoints&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;--tool-strict-level&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5412286614&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56268&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56268/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56268&quot;&gt;#56268&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;code&gt;response_format&lt;/code&gt; with &lt;code&gt;tool_choice=auto&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5400110943&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56086&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56086/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56086&quot;&gt;#56086&lt;/a&gt;), DeepSeek-V4 FIM completions (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4564424627&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44229&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44229/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44229&quot;&gt;#44229&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;code&gt;release_kv_cache_memory()&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;POST /release_kv_cache_memory&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4614120059&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44890&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44890/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44890&quot;&gt;#44890&lt;/a&gt;), fixed-token prefill scoring via &lt;code&gt;prompt_logprob_token_ids&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5285725730&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/54335&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/54335/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/54335&quot;&gt;#54335&lt;/a&gt;), per-request speculative decoding metrics in &lt;code&gt;/inference/v1/generate&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4494119530&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/43310&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/43310/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/43310&quot;&gt;#43310&lt;/a&gt;), per-request metrics (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5332348544&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/55084&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/55084/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/55084&quot;&gt;#55084&lt;/a&gt;) and &lt;code&gt;cache_write_tokens&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5478544188&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57222&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57222/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57222&quot;&gt;#57222&lt;/a&gt;) in the Responses API, Anthropic &lt;code&gt;thinking&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;/v1/messages&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5574015541&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58613&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58613/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58613&quot;&gt;#58613&lt;/a&gt;), streaming reasoning and tool calls from the derender endpoint (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5027982111&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50550&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50550/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50550&quot;&gt;#50550&lt;/a&gt;) with offloaded detokenization (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5497424247&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57528&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57528/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57528&quot;&gt;#57528&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;code&gt;vllm chat&lt;/code&gt; streaming thinking output (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5465260388&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57045&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57045/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57045&quot;&gt;#57045&lt;/a&gt;), request body debug logging with &lt;code&gt;--enable-log-requests&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5541268603&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58163&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58163/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58163&quot;&gt;#58163&lt;/a&gt;), and only the summary line of config docstrings in &lt;code&gt;--help&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5486682781&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57357&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57357/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57357&quot;&gt;#57357&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured output and parsers&lt;/strong&gt;: native Lark grammars in the xgrammar backend (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5551713020&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58321&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58321/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58321&quot;&gt;#58321&lt;/a&gt;), XGrammar 0.2.7 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5481802905&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57272&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57272/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57272&quot;&gt;#57272&lt;/a&gt;), Granite migrated to the streaming Parser Engine (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4963977950&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/49648&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/49648/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/49648&quot;&gt;#49648&lt;/a&gt;), and fixes for reasoning boundaries (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5435532840&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/56635&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56635/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56635&quot;&gt;#56635&lt;/a&gt;), xgrammar choices with control characters (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4845563038&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48115&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48115/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48115&quot;&gt;#48115&lt;/a&gt;), list-typed JSON Schema (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4867679479&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48416&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48416/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48416&quot;&gt;#48416&lt;/a&gt;), empty &lt;code&gt;structural_tag&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4795813130&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47450&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47450/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47450&quot;&gt;#47450&lt;/a&gt;), outlines EOS handling (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5573690174&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58612&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58612/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58612&quot;&gt;#58612&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5515517470&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57743&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57743/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57743&quot;&gt;#57743&lt;/a&gt;), parser-suppressed streaming logprobs (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5571153842&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58583&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58583/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58583&quot;&gt;#58583&lt;/a&gt;), Inkling tool names after reasoning (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5588359739&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/58792&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58792/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58792&quot;&gt;#58792&lt;/a&gt;), and length &lt;code&gt;finish_reason&lt;/code&gt; for truncated streaming tool calls (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4711812557&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46303&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46303/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46303&quot;&gt;#46303&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenAI, Anthropic and Harmony compatibility&lt;/strong&gt;: reasoning token counts for Harmony, DeepSeek-V3 and Step3 (#58626) and per Responses tool round (#58927), Harmony &lt;code&gt;max_output_tokens&lt;/code&gt; in the tool loop (#58551), batched chat completions using the adjusted requests (#58929, #58958), a fresh parser per choice (#58939), deferred reasoning recounts (#56067), Responses MCP cleanup (#56988) and image &lt;code&gt;detail&lt;/code&gt; default (#57241), Anthropic inline system detection (#58754) and disabled thinking with P/D (#58786), stop strings rejected on &lt;code&gt;--tokens-only&lt;/code&gt; servers (#57058), invalid &lt;code&gt;prompt_embeds&lt;/code&gt; returning 400 (#55451, #57006), prompts bounded after multimodal expansion (#57076), &lt;code&gt;--override-generation-config&lt;/code&gt; penalties (#50769), Hub revisions (#56092, #57461), full logprobs in token-in/token-out responses (#58488), generative scoring cancellation (#57729, #58788), gRPC keepalive pings (#55102), and &lt;code&gt;run-batch&lt;/code&gt; diarized transcriptions (#57948).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pooling&lt;/strong&gt;: chunked embedding padding (#56505) and normalization (#57498), reranker tokenization with document limits (#57666), and BERT-family heads kept for raw logits (#57664).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rust frontend&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;--hf-overrides&lt;/code&gt; (#56931), &lt;code&gt;--sse-keep-alive-interval&lt;/code&gt; (#58306), custom chat roles (#58311), MiMo V2.5 parsers (#57933), normalized reasoning controls (#56998), parser-owned output grammars (#55269, #57340), sampling masks over gRPC (#56777), local DP size in gRPC metadata with &lt;code&gt;vllm-proto&lt;/code&gt; 0.3.0 (#57116, #57233), a per-request preemption histogram (#57033), lock-free histograms (#58574), Nemotron-H vision context (#57634), model-owned vision processors (#58109), an &lt;code&gt;mm-processor&lt;/code&gt; benchmark (#51922, #58084, #58378), unsupported serve args recognized (#58330), NaN logprobs no longer killing the engine client (#51026), appended &lt;code&gt;EngineCoreOutput&lt;/code&gt; fields accepted (#56533), and &lt;code&gt;vllm-rs&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;code&gt;PATH&lt;/code&gt; in the CUDA image (#57606).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benchmarks&lt;/strong&gt;: an &lt;code&gt;openai-responses&lt;/code&gt; backend for &lt;code&gt;vllm bench serve&lt;/code&gt; (#54628) and &lt;code&gt;model_id&lt;/code&gt; in latency/throughput JSON (#58112).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Security&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Per-request &lt;code&gt;mm_processor_kwargs&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;media_io_kwargs&lt;/code&gt; are rejected by default; trusted deployments opt in with &lt;code&gt;--trust-request-mm-kwargs&lt;/code&gt; (#58830).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefix-cache block hashes tag extra keys by source (#51899) and include the LoRA path (#59335); multimodal hash input is framed (#54283) and incremental block hashing covers every overlapping feature (#51694).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fresh multimodal payloads take precedence over a stale receiver cache (#57833), and encoder-cache hits with mismatched embedding counts are rejected (#57696).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;min_tokens&lt;/code&gt; above the filled &lt;code&gt;max_tokens&lt;/code&gt; default is rejected instead of wedging the engine (#57731); message sanitization filters upper-case memory addresses (#58832); LoRA adapters named after a served model are rejected (#59286).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Dependencies&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FlashInfer 0.7.0.post1 (#58069, #59323), Transformers 5.17.0 (#56108) with an upper bound in requirements (#59614), XGrammar 0.2.7 (#57272), &lt;code&gt;oss-harmony&lt;/code&gt; replacing &lt;code&gt;openai-harmony&lt;/code&gt; (#55128), DeepGEMM fork pin bump (#57218), FlashKDA bump (#58846), and humming-kernels 0.1.16 (#58054).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CUDA 12 images use LMCache 0.4.4 and CuPy CUDA 12 (#57945); a separately tagged zstd Docker Hub image (&lt;code&gt;-x86_64-zstd&lt;/code&gt;) is published (#55608); Rubin CUDA 13.4 nightly images (#55953).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ROCm: AITER v0.1.23 (#58867), torch 2.13, Triton 3.8 (#50605, #58006), patched ROCR (#57328), LMCache OpenTelemetry pins (#59056).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;XPU: PyTorch 2.14 (#56013). CPU: wheels built on Ubuntu 22.04 (#58515), pre-built Triton CPU (#58140).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Breaking Changes &amp;amp; Deprecations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Per-request &lt;code&gt;mm_processor_kwargs&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;media_io_kwargs&lt;/code&gt; now return an error unless the server is started with &lt;code&gt;--trust-request-mm-kwargs&lt;/code&gt;; server-level &lt;code&gt;--mm-processor-kwargs&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;--media-io-kwargs&lt;/code&gt; and offline &lt;code&gt;LLM&lt;/code&gt; are unchanged (#58830).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;tokenizer_mode=&quot;slow&quot;&lt;/code&gt; was removed; it already behaved like &lt;code&gt;&quot;hf&quot;&lt;/code&gt; under Transformers v5 (#58545).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;--enable-mamba-fine-grained-prefix-cache&lt;/code&gt; was renamed to &lt;code&gt;--enable-mamba-shared-prefix-checkpoint&lt;/code&gt; (#57382).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online quantization through &lt;code&gt;quantization=&quot;fp8&quot;&lt;/code&gt; now redirects to the &lt;code&gt;fp8_per_tensor&lt;/code&gt; online shorthand (#53585); Quark-specific silent online MXFP4 quantization was removed in favor of the online quantization API (#51800).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The AllSpark INT8 W8A16 GEMM backend was removed (#58001). The &lt;code&gt;return_assistant_tokens_mask&lt;/code&gt; option of &lt;code&gt;/render&lt;/code&gt; and the &lt;code&gt;assistant_tokens_mask&lt;/code&gt; response field were removed (#57520).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;VLLM_PLE_CPU_OFFLOAD&lt;/code&gt; was removed; use &lt;code&gt;--engram-config&lt;/code&gt; (#57937). &lt;code&gt;VLLM_XPU_ENABLE_XPU_GRAPH&lt;/code&gt; was removed and XPU graphs are on by default (#51600).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The comma-separated form of &lt;code&gt;--collect-detailed-traces&lt;/code&gt; was removed; use the list syntax (#55702).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New defaults: &lt;code&gt;--enforce-eager&lt;/code&gt; also disables JIT kernel warmup unless fault tolerance is enabled (#58197, #58593); &lt;code&gt;VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1&lt;/code&gt; uses breakable CUDA graphs without torch.compile (#57586) and disables sequence parallelism and async TP (#56377); DeepSeek-V4.1 SWA bounded replay is on (#56227) except on ROCm (#57906); Engram host tables are shared across co-located DP replicas when possible (#57651); FlashMLA mega attention is the DeepSeek-V4.1 default on SM100 (#56935); the AITER w4a4 ASM GEMM is off by default on ROCm (#57055).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model Runner V1 + PP &amp;gt; 1 + async scheduling + structured output is now rejected at startup (#56250); &lt;code&gt;json_object&lt;/code&gt; is rejected at validation with the outlines backend (#57743).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;transformers&lt;/code&gt; now has an upper bound in requirements (#59614).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
